      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sounds like the dialog/tooltip needs to be corrected. It should not mention anything about \"world\".\n\nA kick only kicks the user out of the current instance and prevents them from re-joining that instance for an hour. The user can indeed join another instance or create their own instance if they want. This is the intended behavior.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
